    "draws capital I and lowercase l as the same bare vertical bar, so e.g.",
    "'Illusionist' and 'HondaSlavic' are judgement calls. They are labelled",
    "consistently and are the same in every benchmark configuration, so they",
    "shift all scores by the same constant and do not affect the deltas."
